# Copyrighted raw source texts - keep local only, never push to public repo
# Register metadata/page locators/short quotes instead; see research/drafts/reports/
research/raw_texts/

# Same policy for the runtime OCR full texts used by verbatim re-verification
# (quote_attestation / apply_phase5_relation_landing / adjudicate_phase7_candidates).
# These two books were tracked by mistake from 3e31647 and untracked on 2026-09-28;
# the blobs still exist in history before that date. Keep them local, cite by
# locator + short quote + sha256 instead. The .json here is a table of contents,
# not full text, and stays tracked.
data/processed/runtime_sources/*.txt

# Generated site output
docs/

